---
/* ============================================================================
   Homepage
   ============================================================================
   Homepage architecture (replaces the previous eight-section frame).
   Section order is the IA, not decoration:

     Hero          — "The Reel": the headline, one positioning line and two
                     CTAs on the left; a tilted wall of real client sites
                     drifting in columns on the right (HeroReel). Light in light
                     mode, navy in dark. Studio wordmark lives in the header.
     Selected Work — three featured case studies, asymmetric (one large + two
                     medium). Real client names, real outcomes, real links into
                     /work/{slug} for the long form.
     Pricing Teaser— slim "What it costs" band: the three web-tier floors as a
                     hairline editorial row, routing to /services for the full
                     pricing. Reads numbers from src/data/pricing.ts (shared
                     single source of truth with /services).
     Process Band  — single band that combines the four-step process and the
                     inquiry CTA. Closes the page with one strong block instead
                     of three stacked sections.

   The Footer is rendered by BaseLayout, immediately under the Process Band.

   Services, PhotoStrip, and Testimonials are no longer separate homepage
   sections; each was re-homed where it belongs:
     - Services        → /services and /about already carry the offering copy.
     - PhotoStrip      → /photography is the dedicated photography surface; the
                         homepage carries the work via the hero showcase, not a
                         photo tile strip.
     - Testimonials    → embedded inside individual case study pages, and the
                         /about carousel, where the quote has earned context.

   Architecture decision documented in PRODUCT.md and CLAUDE.md — refresh those
   if the section frame ever needs to shift.
   ============================================================================ */

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import SelectedWork from '../components/SelectedWork.astro';
import PricingTeaser from '../components/PricingTeaser.astro';
import ProcessBand from '../components/ProcessBand.astro';
// The hero headline's font, preloaded on this page only (it is the LCP text).
import bricolageWoff2 from '@fontsource-variable/bricolage-grotesque/files/bricolage-grotesque-latin-wght-normal.woff2?url';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Nixon Creative Studio | Cincinnati websites and photography"
  description="I design and build fast, accessible websites for churches, schools, nonprofits and small businesses. Based in Cincinnati, working with clients anywhere."
  preloadFonts={[bricolageWoff2]}
>
  <Hero />
  <SelectedWork />
  <PricingTeaser />
  <ProcessBand />
</BaseLayout>
